#: ../../docs/support.md:1
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Apoyo"

#: ../../docs/support.md:3
msgid ""
"If you are planning to publish or use data using the OC4IDS then the Open "
"Contracting Partnership and CoST - the Infrastructure Transparency "
"Initiative can provide free-of-charge support."
msgstr ""
"Si planea publicar o utilizar datos utilizando el OC4IDS, la Alianza para "
"las Contrataciones Abiertas y CoST, la Iniciativa de Transparencia de "
"Infraestructura, pueden brindarle soporte gratuito."

#: ../../docs/support.md:5
msgid "We can:"
msgstr "Podemos:"

#: ../../docs/support.md:7
msgid ""
"Help you identify approaches for converting data from your existing systems "
"to OC4IDS;"
msgstr ""
"Ayudarle a identificar estrategias para convertir datos desde sus sistemas "
"existentes a OC4IDS;"

#: ../../docs/support.md:8
msgid ""
"Suggest existing tools and services which might help you publish or use "
"OC4IDS data;"
msgstr ""
"Sugerir herramientas y servicios existentes que podrían ayudarle a publicar "
"o utilizar datos de OC4IDS;"

#: ../../docs/support.md:9
msgid "Provide guidance on mapping your data structures to the standard;"
msgstr "Proveer guía sobre cómo mapear sus estructuras de datos al estándar;"

#: ../../docs/support.md:10
msgid ""
"Give you feedback on draft data files, and support with validation of your "
"data;"
msgstr ""
"Dar retroalimentación sobre borradores de archivos de datos y apoyo para "
"validar sus datos;"

#: ../../docs/support.md:12
msgid "Use the following email addresses to request support:"
msgstr ""
"Utilice las siguientes direcciones de correo electrónico para solicitar "
"soporte:"

#: ../../docs/support.md:14
msgid ""
"[opencode@infrastructuretransparency.org](mailto:opencode@infrastructuretransparency.org)"
" for support from CoST - the Infrastructure Transparency Initiative"
msgstr ""
"[opencode@infrastructuretransparency.org](mailto:opencode@infrastructuretransparency.org)"
" para el apoyo de CoST - la Iniciativa de Transparencia de Infraestructura"

#: ../../docs/support.md:15
msgid ""
"[data@open-contracting.org](mailto:data@open-contracting.org) for support "
"from the Open Contracting Partnership."
msgstr ""
"[data@open-contracting.org](mailto:data@open-contracting.org) para el apoyo "
"de la Alianza para las Contrataciones Abiertas."

#: ../../docs/support.md:17
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribución"

#: ../../docs/support.md:20
msgid ""
"Developers, or those wishing to provide technical input to OC4IDS, can go "
"straight to the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/open-"
"contracting/infrastructure)."
msgstr ""
"Los desarrolladores, o aquellos que deseen brindar información técnica a "
"OC4IDS, pueden ir directamente al [repositorio de "
"GitHub](https://github.com/open-contracting/infrastructure)."
